{`SMTP_HOST=mail.yourdomain.com
SMTP_PORT=587 (or 465)
SMTP_USER=no-reply@yourdomain.com
SMTP_PASS=secured_password
SMTP_FROM="WebzoneBD Team" <no-reply@yourdomain.com>`}
